    "background_story": "Mohammed was a renowned archaeologist who had spent his entire career studying the ancient civilizations of Egypt. He had uncovered numerous significant discoveries, but none could have prepared him for what he was about to find. Deep within a recently unearthed tomb, Mohammed stumbled upon an artifact that left him dumbfounded. It was a small, intricately carved stone that seemed to defy all logical explanation. The symbols etched into its surface were unlike any language he had ever seen before. As he turned the stone over in his hands, he couldn't shake the feeling that he was holding something truly extraordinary. The implications of his discovery were too great to comprehend, and Mohammed was left standing in stunned silence, his mind struggling to wrap around the enormity of what he had uncovered.",
